ET:"P Switch - End";AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
ET:"Door 1 appear";LS:["Door 1"];AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
ET:"Eggman talk 1";MG:"There you are! I have been waiting for you! You see\, I will finally win\, so I just couldn't bear waiting until you went through 8 worlds.";TE:"Eggman talk 2";AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
ET:"Eggman talk 2";MG:"So\, I decided to face you here and now! Oh\, and another thing! You should have never teamed up with that blue hedgehog... Because\, anyone you helps Sonic is a enemy of mine!";TE:"Eggman talk 3";AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
ET:"Eggman talk 3";MG:"Well\, since you are about to die\, I guess I ought to tell you how I made this world. Oh\, it was simple\, all I did was steal the Master Emerald and use it's power to make two opposite worlds!";TE:"Eggman talk 4";AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
ET:"Eggman talk 4";MG:"And\, of course\, you are probably wondering what brought you here and what happened to your plane.";TE:"Eggman talk 5";AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
ET:"Eggman talk 5";MG:"I'll let you know right now\, that it was me that destroyed your plane! Oh\, ho\, ho! And I had such a blast!  OH\, HO\, HO\, HO\, HO!!!";TE:"Eggman talk 6";AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
ET:"Eggman talk 6";MG:"I brought you here hoping to get rid of you once and for all... But... you... were... TOO GOOD TO LOSE!!! You are just as good as Sonic! Also not to mention a pain!";TE:"Eggman talk 7";AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
ET:"Eggman talk 7";MG:"Alright\, enough talking\, more fighting! Oh\, ho\, ho\, ho!";TE:"Eggman move left";AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
